1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,619
What if someone slowly made

2
00:00:01,632 --> 00:00:03,473
you doubt your own memories?

3
00:00:03,503 --> 00:00:05,229
It's called gaslighting.

4
00:00:05,259 --> 00:00:06,452
It starts small.

5
00:00:06,482 --> 00:00:07,949
"I never said that."

6
00:00:07,979 --> 00:00:09,472
"That never happened."

7
00:00:09,502 --> 00:00:11,552
"You're remembering it wrong."

8
00:00:11,587 --> 00:00:12,794
Again and again,

9
00:00:12,824 --> 00:00:14,037
until you start trusting their

10
00:00:14,049 --> 00:00:15,817
version more than your own.

11
00:00:15,847 --> 00:00:16,497
It doesn't just

12
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:17,713
create confusion.

13
00:00:17,743 --> 00:00:19,093
It can damage your confidence

14
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:20,519
in your own judgment.

15
00:00:20,549 --> 00:00:21,449
One disagreement

16
00:00:21,461 --> 00:00:22,694
isn't gaslighting.

17
00:00:22,724 --> 00:00:23,824
The repeated pattern

18
00:00:23,849 --> 00:00:25,182
is what matters.

19
00:00:25,212 --> 00:00:26,494
Write things down.

20
00:00:26,524 --> 00:00:28,336
Talk to people you trust.

21
00:00:28,366 --> 00:00:29,536
And never let someone else

22
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:30,720
become the only source

23
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:32,596
of truth about yourself.
